### Salus API — run with the REST client in Rider, VS or VS Code
@host = http://localhost:5077
@token = paste-the-accessToken-from-step-2

### 1. Create an account (password: at least 10 characters)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "you@example.com", "password": "correct horse battery" }

### 2. Sign in → accessToken (1 hour) + refreshToken
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "you@example.com", "password": "correct horse battery" }

### 3. Who am I, and have I done the quiz?
GET {{host}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Onboarding quiz → archetype match + day-1 forecast
POST {{host}}/api/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "wakeHour": 7,
  "bedHour": 23,
  "schedule": "Office",
  "largestMeal": "Dinner",
  "graze": "Fatigue",
  "skip": "Breakfast",
  "triggers": ["Late", "Stress", "Tv"],
  "cravingType": "Sweet",
  "nudgeStyle": "Mix",
  "timeZoneId": "America/Chicago"
}

### 5. Today's forecast
GET {{host}}/api/me/forecast
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Morning sync: sleep (tap or HealthKit) + calendar
PUT {{host}}/api/me/context/2026-11-20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sleep": "Poor", "backToBackMeetings": true, "activity": "Low" }

### 7. Check in
POST {{host}}/api/me/checkins
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "level": 8, "context": ["Late", "Tv"] }

### 8. Zones waiting for "Was this accurate?"
GET {{host}}/api/me/feedback/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Answer it (Accurate | Missed | DifferentTime + actualHour)
POST {{host}}/api/me/feedback
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-11-20", "zoneStartHour": 17, "verdict": "DifferentTime", "actualHour": 20 }

### 10. Nudges for the phone to schedule (today + tomorrow)
GET {{host}}/api/me/nudges?days=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Renew an expired access token
POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "paste-the-refreshToken-from-step-2" }
